==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Primal Clash|Linoone|112}} from the {{TCG|Primal Clash}} expansion.
*'''Jet Headbutt''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Dragons Exalted|Garchomp|91}} from the {{TCG|Dragons Exalted}} expansion.
